repository-code: "https://github.com/anshlabs716/GeoNav"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
abstract: >-
  KinNav is a FOSS, privacy-first Android navigation platform with opt-in,
  end-to-end-encrypted location sharing. It merges the GeoNav maps/navigation
  app with the Luogo location-sharing engine.
keywords:
  - navigation
  - maps
  - privacy
  - location-sharing
  - free-and-open-source
